---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer • Teer Result Live"
  description="Statutory legal disclaimer and compliance notice for Teer Result Live (teerresultlive.in)."
>
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-slate-700 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs">
    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Statutory Legal Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 text-amber-950 shadow-2xs">
      <p class="font-black text-amber-900">⚠️ Notice to Visitors:</p>
      <p class="mt-1 font-medium">
        Traditional archery (Teer) is a regulated indigenous sport and amusement under the Meghalaya Amusements and Betting Tax (Amendment) Act 1982. This website (<a href="https://teerresultlive.in" class="underline font-bold text-amber-900">teerresultlive.in</a>) is strictly an informational and journalistic media service.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">No Affiliation with Archery Associations</h2>
    <p>
      Teer Result Live is not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the Khasi Hills Archery Sports Association (KHASA), the Meghalaya State Government, or any authorized ticket bookmakers. The official source for all Teer declarations remains the physical scoreboard at Polo Grounds, Shillong.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Zero Gambling / No Commercial Transactions</h2>
    <p>
      We do not engage in the sale, resale, promotion, or facilitation of lottery tickets, betting counters, or prize distribution. We never request monetary deposits, UPI transfers, or bank details. Beware of fraudsters claiming to represent our portal on WhatsApp, Telegram, or social media offering "guaranteed fix numbers" or "VIP slips".
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Jurisdiction &amp; Age Restriction (18+)</h2>
    <p>
      Teer activities are legal only within licensed physical jurisdictions under state law. Users residing in jurisdictions where lottery or archery betting is prohibited by law are solely responsible for compliance with their local regulations. Access to this platform is strictly prohibited for individuals under 18 years of age.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      In no event shall Teer Result Live, its editors, or its developers be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential loss or damages resulting from the use of, or inability to use, information provided on this platform. Users verify all numbers independently at their own discretion.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Contact &amp; Reporting Inaccuracies</h2>
    <p>
      If you notice any clerical error or wish to submit feedback regarding this statutory notice, please contact our team at <a href="mailto:support@teerresultlive.in" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">support@teerresultlive.in</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
